{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":89576,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2018,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sgQevBwNtdTYeUxLf55yujN7SEn.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1794401","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"不卖座的漫画家大树，开始与长着猫耳的少年阿淼共同生活。阿淼可以随意变换姿态，时而变成人形，时而变成毛茸茸的猫，明显不是普通的室友……。大树和阿淼要去便利店买东西，但必须藏好阿淼的耳朵和尾巴……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-08-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pmecEXReGGQQAdmXO1NG386Hjtt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pmecEXReGGQQAdmXO1NG386Hjtt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1794403","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大树买来了用来隐藏阿淼猫耳的帽子。得到心仪帽子的阿淼开心得不得了，闹腾了一番后便迷迷糊糊睡着了。看着阿淼的睡颜，大树回想起了当初与阿淼相遇时的事。沉浸在回忆中没多久，恐怖的编辑长打来了电话……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-09-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ePzJqnXVzo1pf30OcPIgZzQ4aB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ePzJqnXVzo1pf30OcPIgZzQ4aB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1794404","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"大树和阿淼去市场购买火锅食材。在市场里也自由奔放的阿淼，让大树忙得团团转。磕磕绊绊的购物总算结束踏上归途时，拎着沉重行李的阿淼却说要走捷径……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-09-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ePzJqnXVzo1pf30OcPIgZzQ4aB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ePzJqnXVzo1pf30OcPIgZzQ4aB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1794405","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"为了学习做菜，大树与福利院的奶奶通了电话。因为自己的成长经历，大树回想起幼年时感受到的孤独。然而，他向阿淼告白，自从与阿淼相遇后，自己感受到了与他人的接触，以及阿淼对他来说是多么重要的存在……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-09-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6dHFSR9jGXcIyiQHnX2znqpiwT6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6dHFSR9jGXcIyiQHnX2znqpiwT6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1794406","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"阿淼的哥哥冬冬来到了家里。自称“耳朵族”的冬冬向大树告知了猫耳朵的秘密以及阿淼的身世。看到阿淼在冬冬面前彻底安下心来，大树的心情变得复杂。难道阿淼就要这样不在了吗！？","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-09-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fZCwcEgmPqyiV7g51SkTAmV4Ato.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fZCwcEgmPqyiV7g51SkTAmV4Ato.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"1794407","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"冬冬说要带阿淼回去。大树说服自己，和家人冬冬一起生活对阿淼来说才是更好的选择。看到大树这副模样，阿淼做出了大树意想不到的决定……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-09-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xjO9Q8fI6DNQ0rBAMfhKdKu3zGv.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xjO9Q8fI6DNQ0rBAMfhKdKu3zGv.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"1794408","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"看到剪了头发的大树，阿淼哭着说“尾巴不见了”。原来至今为止，阿淼一直把大树的后脑勺头发当成了“尾巴”……。/持续繁重工作、陷入失眠的大树，被金主编命令休假两周。担心大树的金主赶到了他的家中……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fvQVBFcmiVcDPYCUiGCv1tPPc2v.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fvQVBFcmiVcDPYCUiGCv1tPPc2v.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"1794409","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"金主前来探望大树的家。在那里看到的，是大树抱着一个长着猫耳的少年睡在一起的冲击性场景……。“我也想和这么可爱的少年一起生活”，金主嫉妒得浑身发抖。金主作为漫画家的研修，送给大树一次日本旅行，但大树却给出了意外的答复……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xFAN3T2jfRZTwteuXOatQyGrNXF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xFAN3T2jfRZTwteuXOatQyGrNXF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1794410","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"到达日本的阿淼和大树。两人正准备出门观光，但金主的命令让大树必须参加国际漫画交流会。依依不舍的大树只好将阿淼托付给一太丸（耳朵族的忍者）……。然而，两人逐渐无法忍受见不到面的寂寞……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gtervd9GWQv8Q2dlyM3ovNa4V9T.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gtervd9GWQv8Q2dlyM3ovNa4V9T.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1794411","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"作为花样滑冰奖牌得主而闻名的阿强，其实是阿淼认识的耳朵族。他声称是因采访来到日本。阿强看到阿淼和大树的样子，向大树直击核心地问道：“你喜欢阿淼吧？”动摇的大树对阿强的回答是……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-10-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3FYujfc653dVoCmxXsNJGnXvQeJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3FYujfc653dVoCmxXsNJGnXvQeJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"1794412","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"享受日本观光的大树和阿淼。两人一起泡温泉，但阿淼却泡晕了。担心的大树照顾着他，但醒来的阿淼却说自己口渴了……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nqmZnWD8nnamPa4s11tkygXfpAO.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nqmZnWD8nnamPa4s11tkygXfpAO.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"1794413","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"阿淼和大树决定去看烟火大会。两人换上浴衣，尽情享受着日本旅行的最后一天。看着夜空中绽放的烟花，大树一边品味着幸福，一边也感到了“无法回到独自一人”的恐惧……。","language":"zh-CN"},"airDateText":{"value":"2018-11-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c5dwWXEe0bfVhRkLIetrOS7zB6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c5dwWXEe0bfVhRkLIetrOS7zB6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/89576/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793374270264,"status":"ok"}}}
